# Ignore everything by default; only the files listed below are part of the repo.
*

# Source and project
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!HSSQoL.csproj
!*.cs

# Docs: README images, game reference docs (Markdown + standalone HTML), their generators and data
!docs/
